  "plainSummary": "She doesn't deny causing her three children's deaths. The whole trial is one question: was her mind gone — wrecked by postpartum psychosis, as her defense says — or working fine, as prosecutors say? The experts flatly contradict each other, and a verdict could land within days.",
  "statusNow": "The defense rested Friday after 10 witnesses, without putting Clancy on the stand. Prosecutors are now calling their final rebuttal experts — their last chance to convince the jury she wasn't psychotic. Closing arguments are expected Monday or Tuesday. Then the jury takes over.",
